## OpsRelay — .gitignore
## Covers: .NET, Angular, VS Code, JetBrains, Docker

# ============================================================
# .NET / C#
# ============================================================
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vs/
.vs/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/
**/Properties/launchSettings.json

# NuGet
*.nupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]uild/
[Rr]eleases/
[Xx][Mm][Ll][Dd][Oo][Cc]/

# EF Migrations (keep migrations, ignore snapshots in some workflows)
# Intentionally NOT ignoring Migrations/ — EF migrations are committed

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage.cobertura.xml
coverage-report/

# ============================================================
# Angular / Node
# ============================================================
src/Frontend/ops-relay-web/node_modules/
src/Frontend/ops-relay-web/dist/
src/Frontend/ops-relay-web/.angular/
src/Frontend/ops-relay-web/.sass-cache/
*.js.map

# npm
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ============================================================
# Docker
# ============================================================
.docker/

# ============================================================
# IDEs & Editors
# ============================================================

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.ncb
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.cachefile
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.VC.db
_UpgradeReport_Files/
Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.XML
UpgradeLog*.htm
ServiceFabricBackup/
